{
  "info": {
    "name": "Helma Bank API - Smart Periodicity Validation",
    "description": "Collection de tests pour les 3 modes de transaction avec validation intelligente",
    "version": "2.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "✅ VALID - NOW (Immédiat, sans dates)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "*/*",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"beneficiaryName\": \"MAHMOUD\",\n  \"beneficiaryRib\": \"12233455TNZ\",\n  \"amount\": 300,\n  \"type\": \"EXTERNAL\",\n  \"category\": \"MASROUF\",\n  \"description\": \"Versement salaire maintenant\",\n  \"periodicity\": \"NOW\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8082/helma/transactions/add/1",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8082",
          "path": [
            "helma",
            "transactions",
            "add",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        "description": "✅ Mode NOW (immédiat): Aucune date requise\n- Montant débité/crédité IMMÉDIATEMENT\n- Status = CONFIRMED\n- Les champs scheduledDate/nextExecutionDate seront ignorés\n\nRésultat attendu: 200 OK"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "⚠️ INVALID - NOW (avec dates inutiles)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "*/*",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"beneficiaryName\": \"MAHMOUD\",\n  \"beneficiaryRib\": \"12233455TNZ\",\n  \"amount\": 300,\n  \"type\": \"EXTERNAL\",\n  \"category\": \"MASROUF\",\n  \"description\": \"Versement salaire (dates inutiles)\",\n  \"periodicity\": \"NOW\",\n  \"scheduledDate\": \"2026-02-25T10:00:00\",\n  \"nextExecutionDate\": \"2026-03-25T10:00:00\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8082/helma/transactions/add/1",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8082",
          "path": [
            "helma",
            "transactions",
            "add",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        "description": "⚠️ Mode NOW avec dates inutiles:\n- Les dates seront acceptées mais IGNORÉES/NETTOYÉES\n- Dans la réponse: scheduledDate = null, nextExecutionDate = null\n- Transaction exécutée immédiatement quand même\n\nRésultat attendu: 200 OK (mais dates supprimées)\n\n❌ À ÉVITER: C'est du bruit qui sera supprimé"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ VALID - SCHEDULED (avec date future)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "*/*",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"beneficiaryName\": \"Ahmed Bennour\",\n  \"beneficiaryRib\": \"98765432TNZ\",\n  \"amount\": 1000,\n  \"type\": \"EXTERNAL\",\n  \"category\": \"LOYER\",\n  \"description\": \"Paiement loyer février 2026\",\n  \"periodicity\": \"SCHEDULED\",\n  \"scheduledDate\": \"2026-02-25T10:00:00\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8082/helma/transactions/add/1",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8082",
          "path": [
            "helma",
            "transactions",
            "add",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        "description": "✅ Mode SCHEDULED (programmé):\n- scheduledDate OBLIGATOIRE et future\n- Montant NE PAS débité maintenant\n- Status = PENDING (jusqu'à la date)\n- nextExecutionDate ignorée = null\n\nRésultat attendu: 200 OK avec status=PENDING"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "❌ INVALID - SCHEDULED (sans scheduledDate)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "*/*",
            "type": "text"
          }
